      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_select_03",
      "hash64": "A9B6CE034E7F0A6E",
      "text": "真厉害！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_select_04",
      "hash64": "A9B6D1034E7F0F87",
      "text": "不愧是你！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_15",
      "hash64": "9045782F476BC7D8",
      "text": "呵、呵、呵～！\\n厉害吧！厉害吧！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_16",
      "hash64": "90457B2F476BCCF1",
      "text": "呵、呵、呵～！\\n不愧是我！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_17",
      "hash64": "90457A2F476BCB3E",
      "text": "嗯，不过其实我还在试用期内……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s2_side02_0000_camera_18",
      "hash64": "9045752F476BC2BF",
      "text": "据说是要在宣传中用到\\n巨蛋和学生们的抓拍照片，\\r\\n如果可以的话，你的照片也……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
